%% render: auto
%% title: Design-system intelligence
%% desc: References are analyzed for principles, not copied. One approved DESIGN.md governs implementation and critique.
flowchart TD
    A["Authorized references • own brand, licensed or permitted sites"]:::slate
    B["Reference analysis • Designlang extraction, DESIGN.md examples"]:::purple
    C["Visual principles • what to keep, what to reject"]:::purple
    D["Original DESIGN.md • tokens, type, motion, prohibitions"]:::purple
    E["Component implementation • project components, one library"]:::blue
    F["Rendered pages • target widths and states"]:::blue
    G["Design critique • Impeccable detector, Hallmark tiers"]:::green
    A --> B
    B -->|tokens, observations| C
    C --> D
    D -->|approved tokens| E
    E --> F
    F -->|screenshots| G
    G -.->|fix list| E
    G -.->|approved rule change| D
